WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.720
Introducing the Forma Method.

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:06.440
The Forma Method is a comprehensive health
evaluation that uses your mouth

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:11.120
as a window into your overall health, sleep,
inflammation, and longevity.

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:14.960
Instead of looking at one tooth at a time,
we look at the complete picture.

00:00:15.260 --> 00:00:17.000
We ask, why is this happening?

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:18.380
What caused this?

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:19.860
What can we learn from it?

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:22.200
And how can we help prevent future problems?

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:26.460
The goal is not simply healthier teeth, the
goal is a healthier you.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:29.160
Phase one, we call this discover.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.500
This is where we gather information.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:36.480
We use digital photography, intraoral
scanning, facial scanning,

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:41.760
CBCT imaging, comprehensive health
histories, and sleep airway screening.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:45.300
This gives us an incredibly detailed
understanding of your health.

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:47.300
Think of it like creating a blueprint.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:50.080
Before building a home, you need plans.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:53.460
Before creating a personalized health
strategy, we need data.

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:55.420
So why this matters?

00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:58.880
Most people have never seen their oral
health this way.

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:02.820
Many patients are surprised when they learn
their grinding may be related to

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:06.380
airway issues. Their worn teeth may be
connected to sleep problems.

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:09.800
Their inflammation may be affecting more
than just their gums.

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:13.840
Their jaw position may be contributing to
headaches or discomfort.

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:17.300
Their oral bacteria may be influencing
overall health.

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:21.320
The earlier we identify these issues, the
more options we have to address

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:23.280
them. Phase two, understand.

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:25.980
Data by itself doesn't improve health.

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:30.700
Understanding does. After gathering
information, we review everything

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.340
together. We show you exactly what we're
seeing.

00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:38.060
We explain what's healthy, what's
concerning, what may need attention,

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:39.420
and why it matters.

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:43.080
Our patients often tell us this is the first
time they've truly understood

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:44.380
what's happening in their mouth.

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:48.300
No confusing terminology, no pressure, just
clarity.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:51.700
Phase 3. Personalized Health Plan.

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:53.740
Every patient is different.

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:56.700
That's why every Forma Method plan is
customized.

00:01:57.320 --> 00:02:01.320
Your plan may include preventative care,
airway improvements,

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:06.040
sleep evaluation, bite optimization, gum
therapy,

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:10.600
smile enhancement, nutritional
recommendations, and long -term health

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:12.660
monitoring. The goal is simple.

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:16.940
Help you maintain your health, health,
function, appearance, and quality of

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:18.260
life for decades to come.

00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:23.620
The Longevity Connection One of the reasons
patients are so excited about

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:27.320
the Forma Method is because it aligns with a
growing interest in longevity.

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:29.440
People want more than treatment.

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:30.600
They want prevention.

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:32.060
They want answers.

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:33.500
They want to age well.

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:37.920
The mouth provides valuable clues about
what's happening throughout the rest of

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:42.420
the body. By identifying concerns earlier,
we can often help patients make

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:45.380
better decisions before or problems become
larger.